{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46153","headline":"闻许棠及第因寄桂雍 · 贯休","name":"闻许棠及第因寄桂雍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时清道合出尘埃，清苦爲诗不杖媒。\n今日桂枝平折得，几年春色并将来。\n势扶九万风初极，名到三山花正开。\n更有平人居蛰屋，还应爲作一声雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}